decoder/ is derived from the CELP decoder of jr-conventional-line-radio-receiver
(crates/jr-voice/src/celp, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 KIRISHIKI Yudai), whose
fixed-point DSP and tables come from mcelp-codec (MIT, same author); its notice is
in decoder/LICENSE. The test audio (encoder/tests/vectors/speech.pcm) is an excerpt
of LibriSpeech (CC BY 4.0, V. Panayotov, G. Chen, D. Povey, S. Khudanpur), made
from LibriVox public-domain audiobooks.
